  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, direction of electromagnetic wave will be in the direction of the vector&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0053_35f8f8c4e9e5.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 239px;\" /></p><p>Magnitude of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mi>E</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
